Z||000001||Monkeyman||12-13-1999||12:18 AM||||Get the schematics for both.  I'm putting a digidash from an '86 Buick Regal Somerset in mine.  I don't know anything about that stuff, but I have a digidash genius working on that as we speak.  If you know what you're doing, I don't see where it would be a problem.  Your local Chevy dealer will have the schematics for the Cavalier, although you may have to beg and plead for them.  I had to for my info.  Good luck.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DJRice||12-13-1999||02:37 PM||||We discussed this a while back as well.  Set the fourm to display all topics for last month and see what you can find.  also search for digital dash or digital gauges.<P>As i recall, several people had indicated accuracy problems with the cavalier instrumentation.||||reg||1
